CM_ "HS-CAN 500 kbit/s, 2011-2012 Super Duty cluster side. Decoded from a friend 2011 F-350 6.7L (VIN 1FT8W3BT4BE******), drive log 2021-06-08. Bo cluster/electronics are from a 2012 F-350 Lariat: assumed same HS layout as the 2011 (unverified). Byte numbers b0..b7, Ford big-endian.";
CM_ BO_ 513 "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Engine speed + vehicle speed, 10 ms. Translator writes this to the cluster (cluster gauges RPM and speedo).";
CM_ SG_ 513 EngineSpeed "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b0-1 /4. Idle 550-640 rpm, max 1199 on the drive. Low 3 bits always 011 (resolution 8 counts = 2 rpm). Translator sets low nibble to 3.";
CM_ SG_ 513 VehicleSpeed "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b2-3 0.01 km/h. Max 24.6 km/h on the drive. Checked vs gear ratio: speed/rpm per gear fits 3.55 axle and ~32in tyres (assumed), 0.01 mph does not fit. Same value as 0x415 b0-1.";
CM_ SG_ 513 Unknown_B4_5 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Load-like value (r=0.76 with RPM), 0 at idle, b5 only 00/40/80/C0. Translator sends 0.";
CM_ SG_ 513 Unknown_B6 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Constant 0x18 on the drive. Translator sends 0x00.";
CM_ SG_ 513 Unknown_B7 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Constant 0x00.";
CM_ BO_ 560 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Transmission (6R140): gear, trans temp, current ratio. ~16 ms. Translator writes 22 50 00 g 00 13 88 00.";
CM_ SG_ 560 GearEngaged "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b0 high nibble. Seen 0, E (reverse while backing out), 1, 2, 3; matches b5-6 ratios. 4-6 not observed.";
CM_ SG_ 560 ShiftState "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b0 low nibble: 3 for ~1.3 s at each upshift/downshift, else 2.";
CM_ SG_ 560 Unknown_B1 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Constant 0x60 on the drive. Translator sends 0x50.";
CM_ SG_ 560 Unknown_B2 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] 00 at start, 10 in reverse, 30 in forward gears. Translator sends 0x00.";
CM_ SG_ 560 TransFluidTemp "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b3. Identity as trans temp medium (translator feeds it from the 2005 0x225 b7 via a curve; Bo remembers translating trans temp). Offset -60 is a GUESS (raw 0x8B-0x8C on a warm short drive = 79 degC/174 degF). Alternative -40.";
CM_ SG_ 560 Unknown_B4 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Constant 0x00.";
CM_ SG_ 560 GearRatio "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b5-6 x0.001: 3.97/2.32/1.52 in 1/2/3, ~3.13 reverse, 5.000 at P/N. Exactly the 6R140 ratios.";
CM_ SG_ 560 Unknown_B7 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] 0x40 during reverse, else 0x00.";
CM_ BO_ 342 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Engine temperatures, 100 ms. Translator writes t 7E 00 00 03 0C 00 00 with t = 2005 0x420 b0 + 16.";
CM_ SG_ 342 EngineCoolantTemp "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b0 = ECT: identity medium (Bo translated ECT here). Offset -60 is LOW confidence: raw 0x93-0x95 -> 87-89 degC/189-192 degF warm; with -40 it would be 225-228 degF. Truck was warm, no warm-up in log.";
CM_ SG_ 342 PossibleOilTemp "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b1 tracks b0 within 1-2 counts (0x92-0x95): maybe engine oil temp. Offset guess as b0. Translator sends static 0x7E.";
CM_ SG_ 342 Unknown_B4 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Constant 0x03 (translator 0x03).";
CM_ SG_ 342 Unknown_B5 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] 0x0C at standstill around start/shift into drive, else 0x00. Translator sends static 0x0C.";
CM_ BO_ 1031 "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN); Bo 2026-10-22] Boost gauge (confirmed by Bo, who translated boost into 0x407). 20 ms. Translator: v=map(2005 0x200 b7,0..254,256..735) into b0-1, b2=0.";
CM_ SG_ 1031 BoostRaw "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN); Bo 2026-10-22] b0-1, scaling UNPROVEN: 300 at idle, 318 max on a light sub-1200 rpm drive, r=+0.85 with RPM. Hypothesis 1/3 kPa absolute (300=100 kPa atmospheric, 318=106 kPa=0.9 psi). Needs a reading with a known boost (scan tool) to confirm; left raw on purpose.";
CM_ SG_ 1031 Unknown_B2 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN); Bo 2026-10-22] 0x35-0x6D, moves opposite to load (r=-0.89 with RPM). Unknown. Translator sends 0.";
CM_ BO_ 1045 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Second speed source, 50 ms (likely ABS, sender unverified). Translator sends static 00 00 00 00 00 80 80 00, i.e. speed 0: possible odometer/chime impact.";
CM_ SG_ 1045 VehicleSpeed "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b0-1 0.01 km/h, median +0.04 km/h vs 0x201 b2-3.";
CM_ SG_ 1045 Unknown_B2 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Constant 0x0C (translator 0x00).";
CM_ SG_ 1045 Unknown_B5 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] 0x7E-0x86 (translator 0x80).";
CM_ SG_ 1045 Unknown_B6 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] 0x7E then 0x80 (translator 0x80).";
CM_ BO_ 1056 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Format 00 00 00 00 00 00 XX FF, 100 ms. Translator sends 00..00 73 FF only when the 2005 0x420 b4 != 0x40.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 Unknown_B6 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] 0x5E-0x90, dips on lift-off, not temperature-like. Translator static 0x73.";
CM_ SG_ 1056 Unknown_B7 "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Constant 0xFF.";
CM_ BO_ 1072 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Odometer candidate, 20 ms. Not sent by the translator. Sender unknown (cluster or PCM).";
CM_ SG_ 1072 Unknown_B0_2 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] Constant 00 01 00.";
CM_ SG_ 1072 OdometerCandidate "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] b3-5 = 217206 -> 217207 at t=49.7 s after 0.08 km driven; 0.75 km more without another step. Consistent with whole km or mi. Confirm against an odometer reading.";
CM_ SG_ 1072 Unknown_B6_7 "[conf=low] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN)] 09D0 then 0990.";
CM_ BO_ 1034 "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN); MS candump 2020-06-02 19:13/19:16 (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus)] Multiplexed by b0-1 (C1xx = VIN parts, C000 = clock). 200 ms per frame. Same VIN 1FT8W3BT4BE****** (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L) appears on HS and MS.";
CM_ SG_ 1034 MuxId "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN); MS candump 2020-06-02 19:13/19:16 (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus)] b0-1 selects the payload.";
CM_ SG_ 1034 VIN_Chars_1_6 "[conf=high] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN); MS candump 2020-06-02 19:13/19:16 (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus)] ASCII, e.g. 1FT8W3.";
