CM_ SG_ 1034 RealTimeClock "[conf=medium] [src=drive log 2021-06-08 (friend 2011 F-350 6.7L, HS-CAN); MS candump 2020-06-02 19:13/19:16 (friend 2011 F-350 truck bus)] b3-6 x0.1 s, +12 counts per 1.2 s. Epoch back-calculates to ~2010-10-16 in both the 2020 MS log and the 2021 HS log (within 32 min), so a real-time clock, NOT the odometer.";
